sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin/HR
    participant View as "Web View (admin.master.leave-types.index)"
    participant C as LeaveTypeController
    participant LT as "LeaveType Model"
    participant LR as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Buka halaman Data Master Tipe Cuti
    View->>C: GET /admin/master/leave-types (dengan/without search)

    C->>LT: Ambil data leave type + leave_requests_count
    LT->>DB: SELECT leave_types + COUNT leave_requests + pagination
    DB-->>LT: Hasil query

    alt Data valid
        C-->>View: Render daftar tipe cuti
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan list, filter, pagination
    else Data tidak valid
        C-->>View: Redirect/back + pesan error
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan error
    end
